# Tutorials

Learn how to build with PIE through step-by-step guides and practical examples.

## Getting Started Tutorials

New to PIE? Start here:

- **[Quick Start](/docs/getting-started)** - Install PIE and render your first question
- **[Core Concepts](/docs/core-concepts)** - Understand PIE's architecture

## Development Tutorials

### Building PIE Elements

Learn how to create custom question types:

- **[Creating a New PIE Element](/docs/tutorials/creating-elements)** - Design and build a custom element from scratch
- **[Element Interface & Packaging](/docs/tutorials/element-interface)** - Understanding the PIE element contract
- **[Setting Up in pie-elements](/docs/tutorials/pie-elements-setup)** - Working within the monorepo

### Implementing Element Logic

Master the controller functions:

- **[Designing the Model Function](/docs/tutorials/model-function)** - Build student and instructor views
- **[Implementing Scoring with outcome()](/docs/tutorials/outcome-function)** - Calculate scores and validate responses
- **[Role-Based Display Logic](/docs/tutorials/role-based-logic)** - Handle different modes and roles

### Authoring Interface

Create visual editors for your elements:

- **[Building an Authoring Interface](/docs/tutorials/authoring-interface)** - Design the configuration UI
- **[Using pie-author Components](/docs/tutorials/pie-author-components)** - Leverage existing authoring tools

### Backend Integration

Build a complete PIE-powered application:

- **[Designing a PIE Backend](/docs/tutorials/backend-design)** - Architecture and API design
- **[Learning from pie-api-aws](/docs/tutorials/pie-api-aws-guide)** - Real-world backend implementation
- **[Securing Assessment Data](/docs/tutorials/security-best-practices)** - Keep answers and scoring logic safe

